# Template for local `wrangler dev` secrets.
#
# NOT currently in use — as of this file's creation, nobody has run
# `wrangler dev` against real credentials, and no `.dev.vars` exists in this
# project. All local testing happens through `npm test` (vitest), which mocks
# WhatsApp, the LLM, and Google Sheets entirely — it needs none of this.
#
# Real values live ONLY in Cloudflare (Workers & Pages > repair-bot-worker >
# Settings > Variables and Secrets). They cannot be read back once set —
# `npx wrangler secret list` shows names only, never values — so if you want
# to run `wrangler dev` against real services, copy this file to `.dev.vars`
# and fill each value in from the Cloudflare dashboard, or from wherever your
# own copies of these credentials are kept (password manager, Meta/Google
# consoles, etc). `.dev.vars` is gitignored; this example file is not.
#
# vars declared in wrangler.jsonc (BOT_ENABLED, LLM_PROVIDER, etc.) are
# already available to `wrangler dev` automatically and do not belong here —
# this file is only for the SECRETS listed in README.md.

WA_TOKEN=
WA_PHONE_NUMBER_ID=
WA_VERIFY_TOKEN=
STAFF_WA_NUMBER=

GEMINI_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_EMAIL=
GOOGLE_PRIVATE_KEY=

TEST_ALLOWLIST=
DELISTED_NUMBERS=

BRANCH_NUMBERS=
BRANCH_TEMPLATE_NAME=

META_APP_SECRET=
EMBEDDED_SIGNUP_URL=
